"past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1094.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He said: Shall I seek for you a god other than Allah when He hath favoured you above (all) creatures?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Sizi âlemlere üstün kılan Allah olduğu halde, ben size O'ndan başka ilâh mı arayayım! dedi.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کہا کیا اللہ کے سوا تمہارا اور کوئی خدا تلاش کروں حالانکہ اس نے تمہیں زمانے بھر پر فضیلت دی", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Musa menjawab: \"Patutkah aku mencari Tuhan untuk kamu yang selain dari pada Allah, padahal Dialah yang telah melebihkan kamu atas segala umat.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَغَيْرَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَبْغِيكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَٰهًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَهُوَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَضَّلَكُمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/06bf246e70a31796ac7f.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it preferred you (all)", "bs": "dao vam je prednost", "tr": "sizi tercih etti", "fr": "il vous a préférés", "id": "dia telah mengutamakan kalian", "ur": "اُس نے تم سب کو ترجیح دی", "bn": "সে তোমাদের অগ্রাধিকার দিয়েছে", "fa": "شما را برتری داد"}}, {"text": "عَلَى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "6:86", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/875.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And Ishmael and Elisha and Jonah and Lot. Each one (of them) did We prefer above (Our) creatures,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İsmail, Elyesa, Yunus ve Lut'u da (hidayete erdirdik). Hepsini âlemlere üstün kıldık.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اسماعیل اور یسع اور یونس اور لوط کو، اور ہم نے ہر ایک کو اس کے وقت میں سب پر فضیلت دی", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "dan Ismail, Alyasa', Yunus dan Luth. Masing-masing Kami lebihkan derajatnya di atas umat (di masanya),", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَإِسْمَٰعِيلَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱلْيَسَعَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَيُونُسَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلُوطًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَكُلًّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَضَّلْنَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/99c909c6e80d327056ce.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "odlikovali smo", "en": "We favoured", "tr": "üstün kıldık", "fr": "Nous avons favorisé", "id": "Kami melebihkan", "ur": "ہم نے فضیلت دی", "bn": "আমরা শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব দিয়েছি", "fa": "برتری دادیم"}}, {"text": "عَلَى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "2:47", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "ana", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/54.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "O Children of Israel! Remember My favour wherewith I favoured you and how I preferred you to (all) creatures.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ey İsrailoğulları! Size verdiğim nimeti ve vaktiyle sizi âlemlere üstün kıldığımı hatırlayın.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اے اولاد یعقوب یاد کرو میرا وہ احسان جو میں نے تم پر کی